WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.164 --> 00:00:06.317
- [Allison] Charlie is a beautiful

00:00:06.317 --> 00:00:08.596
long-haired Persian Blue cat,

00:00:08.596 --> 00:00:10.232
and he's really special.

00:00:10.232 --> 00:00:12.754
Charlie's gonna get his
first lion cut today.

00:00:12.754 --> 00:00:14.069
(lion roars)

00:00:14.069 --> 00:00:18.908
("The Donk Main" by
Warner/Chappell Production Music)

00:00:22.528 --> 00:00:24.549
He's never really had a haircut.

00:00:24.549 --> 00:00:27.056
He has dreads, he's dirty and disgusting,

00:00:27.056 --> 00:00:27.811
and it's time.

00:00:31.317 --> 00:00:32.808
Um... (laughs)

00:00:32.808 --> 00:00:33.518
No!

00:00:33.518 --> 00:00:36.191
By the looks of it, I don't
think he's very excited.

00:01:14.163 --> 00:01:15.176
Charlie!

00:01:15.176 --> 00:01:17.454
How are you, little baby?

00:01:17.454 --> 00:01:20.274
Oh my God! (laughs)

00:01:20.274 --> 00:01:21.529
You're perfect!

00:01:21.529 --> 00:01:24.638
He's not even looking at me, he's so mad.

00:01:26.838 --> 00:01:29.153
(laughs)

00:01:29.153 --> 00:01:31.146
He's a little rat boy!

00:01:32.064 --> 00:01:33.055
Think it's really cute.

00:01:33.055 --> 00:01:34.580
I think he's gonna be happy.

00:01:36.190 --> 00:01:39.488
(laughing) He doesn't
seem that happy right now.

00:01:39.488 --> 00:01:41.337
But I think he just wants to be freed.

00:01:41.337 --> 00:01:43.091
Kind of was traumatized.

00:01:43.091 --> 00:01:45.477
Yeah, I think this is a
good makeover for Charlie.

00:01:45.477 --> 00:01:48.550
(laughing) Okay, I'll let
you go, I'll let you go.

00:01:48.550 --> 00:01:51.211
Now, he's so small,
he's the smallest thing.

00:01:51.211 --> 00:01:53.606
I thought he was like, this big boy cat.

00:01:53.606 --> 00:01:54.926
Yeah, I'm so happy with it!

00:01:54.926 --> 00:01:56.260
He looks so cute.

